{"name": "Carnholt", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras_big/80aa8db247e12156a8a0d1f4476e24ec.webp?t=1785524691\" height=\"267\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/80aa8db247e12156a8a0d1f4476e24ec.avif?t=1785524691\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft a deck of wild creatures and powerful spells, fight in tactical battles, and slay a God that refused death.\u00a0<strong>Carnholt</strong> is a deckbuilding roguelike where victory comes only to those willing to bargain with ancient powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To defeat your foes, fight with cunning and harness powerful synergies between wild creatures and ancient powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"594\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.poster.avif?t=1785524691\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.webm?t=1785524691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.mp4?t=1785524691\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounter mysterious creatures and uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.poster.avif?t=1785524691\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.webm?t=1785524691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.mp4?t=1785524691\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through a constantly shifting world to discover wild creatures, forgotten relics, and equipment. Strengthen your build and forge a deck capable of unleashing devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.poster.avif?t=1785524691\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.webm?t=1785524691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.mp4?t=1785524691\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/c05ee1946ced9f0039b807a94f47ada5.avif?t=1785524691\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each companion comes with its own deck, upgrades, and unique passive abilities that reshape the way you play. Learn their strengths, adapt your strategy and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/a38fcbc3d3a3230b2710cfe76595dedc.avif?t=1785524691\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an illustrator, <strong>Carnholt</strong> has been a passion project that allowed me to bring to life all the paintings I created over the last few years. Every art asset in the game was made by me, and I even included a few of my oil paintings. I hope you'll enjoy exploring the world I created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maxime Minard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Craft a deck of wild creatures and powerful spells, fight in tactical battles, and slay a God that refused death. Carnholt is a deckbuilding roguelike where victory comes only to those willing to bargain with ancient powers.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/8cc40e20d204320dbd6b347e989393b07e1d22a8/header.jpg?t=1785524691", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Roguelike", "Card Game", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Card Battler", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "Maxime Minard", "publishers": "Maxime Minard", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4544140", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "31 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/U-rJQkcp0sM", "first_seen": 1785448800.0, "review_rank": 208}